# Local scratch workspace for staged refactoring work: progress ledgers,
# task briefs, generated diffs and review reports. Not part of the package.
/.superpowers/

# Planning and review notes: working records for whoever is doing the work,
# not part of the package and not shipped. Kept on disk, out of git.
#
# These were partly tracked before, and the split was the problem: the same
# kind of document lived in two places with opposite rules, and a local
# `.git/info/exclude` entry silently stopped new files from joining the tracked
# ones -- so a plan written under docs/superpowers/plans/ looked saved and was
# never committed. One rule, stated here where it is shared, rather than a
# committed comment claiming these are tracked and a local rule ensuring they
# are not.
#
# What this means in practice: a plan or spec here does NOT survive a fresh
# clone. Anything that has to outlive the working copy belongs in CHANGELOG.md,
# in a docstring next to the code it describes, or in docs/source/.
/docs/superpowers/
/docs/plans/
